description:
Render text as a FIGlet ASCII art banner in one of 7 bundled fonts (Standard, Slant, Small, Big, Doom, ANSI Shadow, Mini), optionally wrapped at a column width and inside code comment markers. Printable ASCII only. The page at redbison.dev/ascii-art-text-generator has more fonts.

Returns: Text: the banner (show it in a monospace code block). structuredContent { art, font, lines, columns, unsupported[] }.
Example input: {"text":"Hello","font":"Slant","layout":"default","width":80,"comment":"none"}
